"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You still letting what happened two years ago get to you?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Well, "
"I mean, at the ⟪k:7⟫time⟪k:8⟫, things were a total disaster."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sei ancora preoccupato per quello che è successo due anni fa?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"Insomma, sai, in quel periodo le cose erano un totale disastro."

