msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫After it all came out, she turned over a new leaf.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫She started doting on me "
"somethin’ serious, and well, it’s hard not to let one little mistake like that go when she’s "
"trying so hard to make up with me."
